      "Detects React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, TypeScript, Tailwind, and CSS-in-JS signals from project files.",
      "Decomposes prototype interfaces into reusable components using an atomic design approach.",
      "Extracts colors, typography, spacing, radius, shadow, and animation values into design-token structures.",
      "Generates typed component structures with accessibility attributes, variants, sizes, and integration guidance.",
      "Provides HTML-to-React conversion patterns for attributes, events, forms, images, routing, and focus management."
